{{Top}}
[[File:AT-AT_DICE.png|thumb|200px|An [[All Terrain Armored Transport]]]]
{{Quote|If by ''transport'' you mean something to get you from here to there, of course it's a transport. If you mean ''civilian transport'', though, I'm afraid that's not what we're doing today.|[[Qilori]] describes the ''[[Deathless]]''|<ref name="Chaos Rising">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Chaos Rising]]''</ref>}}
A '''transport''' was a type of 'medium-to-large' vehicle utilised to ferry civilians, military personnel<ref name="SW EOSAOV (SE)">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia of Starfighters and Other Vehicles (second edition)]]''</ref> or cargo from one location to another.<ref name="Visual Guide">''[[Star Wars: Rogue One: The Ultimate Visual Guide]]''</ref> They could be used on [[planet]]s, such as through [[water]],<ref name="Episode I">{{Film|I}}</ref> terrain,<ref name="Episode V">{{Film|V}}</ref> starcruisers, or they could be used in [[Realspace|space]].<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref>

